\description{
\code{forceatlas2_gpu()} and \code{layout_forceatlas2_gpu()} are the counterparts of
\code{\link[=forceatlas2]{forceatlas2()}} and \code{\link[=layout_forceatlas2]{layout_forceatlas2()}} that compute the repulsion
